{"id":"7cd0504ab191f721","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-categorical-pushout.md","title":"Categorical Pushout","display":"df-categorical-pushout — Categorical Pushout","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-categorical-pushout","aliases":["58-df-categorical-pushout"],"display":"df-categorical-pushout — Categorical Pushout","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-categorical-pushout"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-categorical-pushout</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-categorical-pushout — Categorical Pushout"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (category data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,q\\in C_0\">\\(a,b,c,q\\in C_0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,p,r\\in C_1\">\\(f,g,p,r\\in C_1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (pushout predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}pushout}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}(q,p,r,f,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land a,b,c,q\\in C_0\n\\land f,g,p,r\\in C_1\n\\land s(f)=a\\land t(f)=b\n\\land s(g)=a\\land t(g)=c\n\\land s(p)=b\\land t(p)=q\n\\land s(r)=c\\land t(r)=q\n\\land p\\circ f=r\\circ g\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall z\\in C_0\\;\\forall u,v\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\ns(u)=b\\land t(u)=z\\land s(v)=c\\land t(v)=z\\land u\\circ f=v\\circ g\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\to\\exists!h\\in C_1\\;(\ns(h)=q\\land t(h)=z\\land h\\circ p=u\\land h\\circ r=v)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}pushout}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}(q,p,r,f,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land a,b,c,q\\in C_0\n\\land f,g,p,r\\in C_1\n\\land s(f)=a\\land t(f)=b\n\\land s(g)=a\\land t(g)=c\n\\land s(p)=b\\land t(p)=q\n\\land s(r)=c\\land t(r)=q\n\\land p\\circ f=r\\circ g\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall z\\in C_0\\;\\forall u,v\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\ns(u)=b\\land t(u)=z\\land s(v)=c\\land t(v)=z\\land u\\circ f=v\\circ g\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\to\\exists!h\\in C_1\\;(\ns(h)=q\\land t(h)=z\\land h\\circ p=u\\land h\\circ r=v)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pushouts are colimits of spans.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle$ and $\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)$ (category data, see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c,q\\in C_0","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,p,r\\in C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}pushout}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}(q,p,r,f,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land a,b,c,q\\in C_0\n\\land f,g,p,r\\in C_1\n\\land s(f)=a\\land t(f)=b\n\\land s(g)=a\\land t(g)=c\n\\land s(p)=b\\land t(p)=q\n\\land s(r)=c\\land t(r)=q\n\\land p\\circ f=r\\circ g\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall z\\in C_0\\;\\forall u,v\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\ns(u)=b\\land t(u)=z\\land s(v)=c\\land t(v)=z\\land u\\circ f=v\\circ g\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\to\\exists!h\\in C_1\\;(\ns(h)=q\\land t(h)=z\\land h\\circ p=u\\land h\\circ r=v)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1337,"backlinks":[{"id":"3c043773cb49e8df","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}$ (canonical pushout predicate, see [[58-df-categorical-pushout]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-categorical-pushout.md|58-df-categorical-pushout]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c"]}